# Day 21/60 — Digital Privacy Intelligence Dashboard

## Objective

Build a dashboard that visualizes digital privacy exposure and online footprint risks.

## Features Explored

- Digital Footprint Score
- Privacy Score Analysis
- Exposure Heatmap
- Company Exposure Rankings
- Digital Twin Profile
- Risk Radar
- Privacy Improvement Simulator

## What I Learned

### Privacy Is Data Visualization

Complex privacy risks become easier to understand when represented visually.

### AI Accelerates Dashboard Creation

Claude can rapidly generate functional analytics interfaces from detailed prompts.

### Digital Footprints Matter

Every online interaction contributes to a larger profile that organizations can use for targeting, analytics, and personalization.

### Security Starts With Awareness

Understanding what information is exposed is the first step toward improving privacy.

## Key Insight

Privacy is no longer just a technical topic.

It is becoming a digital literacy skill that everyone should understand.

